# Local configuration
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# config.py files are MACHINE-LOCAL and must NEVER be committed.
# train.py ALWAYS loads config.py (via  import config as cfg).
# The versioned reference/template is  config.active.py  (edit that in git,
# then copy it to config.py on each machine and apply local overrides).
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
train_config.json
activate.sh
vsr_plus_plus/config.py
vsr_plusplus_NEU/config.py

# dataset_generator_v2 – machine-local config (never commit)
# generator_config.json        → the live config used by all tools at runtime
# generator_config_active.json → read-only agent-review snapshot; never used in code
dataset_generator_v2/generator_config.json
dataset_generator_v2/generator_config_active.json

# Temporary files

# Dataset file-index cache (auto-generated by VSRDataset)
**/.vsr_index/

# ice_brain
ice_brain/config.py
ice_brain/*.gguf

